<title>UK: KfW unit sets $150 million six-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets $150 million six-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank and Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    04.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.70     SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
